{"strongs": "H5891", "word": "עֵיפָה", "translit": "e.phah", "root": "עיפה", "morph": "N:N-M-P", "pos": "proper name", "gloss": "'son' of Midian", "definition": "II. עֵיפָה proper name 1. of a people 'son' of Midian Gen 25:4 ( J ) = 1Chr 1:33 , compare Isa 60:6 , ᵐ5 Γαφερ , Γεφαρ , Γαιφα ( ρ ). 2. masculine name in Judah 1Chr 2:47 , ᵐ5 Γαιφα . 3. feminine concubine of Caleb 1Chr 2:46 , ᵐ5 Γαιφαηλ , A Γαιφα ἡ , ᵐ5 L Γαιφα .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5899')\">BDB5899</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H5891')\">H5891</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5898')\">BDB5898</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5900')\">BDB5900</entry></div><p> II. <bdbheb>עֵיפָה</bdbheb> <b>proper name</b> <div class=\"point\"><b>1. of a people</b> <highlightword>'son' of Midian</highlightword> <ref ref=\"Gen 25:4\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(1,25,4)\">Gen 25:4</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>) = <ref ref=\"1Chr 1:33\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(13,1,33)\">1Chr 1:33</ref>, compare <ref ref=\"Isa 60:6\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"60\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"60\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(23,60,6)\">Isa 60:6</ref>, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <grk>Γαφερ</grk>, <grk>Γεφαρ</grk>, <grk>Γαιφα</grk>(<grk>ρ</grk>). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2. masculine</b> <highlightword>name in Judah</highlightword> <ref ref=\"1Chr 2:47\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"47\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"47\" onclick=\"bcv(13,2,47)\">1Chr 2:47</ref>, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <grk>Γαιφα</grk>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3. feminine</b> <highlightword>concubine of Caleb</highlightword> <ref ref=\"1Chr 2:46\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"46\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"46\" onclick=\"bcv(13,2,46)\">1Chr 2:46</ref>, <lookup onclick=\"bdb